From 720eaf5f9103fb3e61d156d7259a2a2e35161007 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Moudy Ho <moudy.ho@mediatek.com>
Date: Fri, 8 May 2026 08:46:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 28/35] GENIO: media: platform: mtk-mdp3: fix dead code in
 mdp_alg_submit

Fix incorrect NULL check and unreachable return statement. The original
code checked the array pointer instead of the array element, making the
condition always false. Also, return -ENOMEM instead of uninitialized ret.

Coverity issue:
(4) Event dead_error_line: Execution cannot reach this statement:
"return ret;".

Change-Id: If2355b767a2897a0071aa914cab977ba0231770e
Signed-off-by: Moudy Ho <moudy.ho@mediatek.com>
---
 drivers/media/platform/mediatek/mdp3/mdp_alg_core.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/mediatek/mdp3/mdp_alg_core.c b/drivers/media/platform/mediatek/mdp3/mdp_alg_core.c
index 23fc93dd8d8d..cdae2188a9f6 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/mediatek/mdp3/mdp_alg_core.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/mediatek/mdp3/mdp_alg_core.c
@@ -557,8 +557,8 @@ int mdp_alg_submit(struct mdp_alg_task *task)
 
 	for (i = 0; i < pipe_used; i++) {
 		cmd[i] = prepare_cmdq(task, i);
-		if (!cmd)
-			return ret;
+		if (!cmd[i])
+			return -ENOMEM;
 
 		ret = prepare_comp(task, i);
 		if (ret)
-- 
2.45.2

